    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The response time requirement of below 2 seconds for common queries is FULLY COVERED as our platform's common single-document queries are below 2 seconds at p95 latency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with the client's existing information systems is FULLY COVERED through our API-first design, which includes documented APIs and the ability to be embedded in existing work environments, along with standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH DPI integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with user directories is FULLY COVERED as our support SSO via SAML and OIDC, and user directories such as LDAP and Entra ID." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The hosting requirement on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU is FULLY COVERED through our Sovereign HDS tier hosted on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and the EU-only." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The requirement for no dependency on non-European suppliers is PARTIALLY COVERED because while our have a sovereign European open-weight model that meets The requirement for no dependency on non-European suppliers, our also offer top-tier proprietary models accessed via API, some of which are operated by non-European providers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To fully meet The tender requirements, our would propose using our sovereign European open-weight model hosted on OuraneCloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would thus involve deploying our Atelier platform on the Sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud, utilizing our sovereign European open-weight model hosted on OuraneCloud, and integrating with the client's existing information systems and user directories through our API-first design and supported SSO and directory services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also comply with regulatory requirements such as the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security measures can we implement to ensure compliance with these regulations? we can implement several security measures to ensure compliance with GDPR and HDS certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data hosting, we partnership with OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, ensures that all data is hosted within EU, with no transfers outside EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption, we use TLS 1.3 for data in transit and AES-256 for data at rest. we also have key management in place through we EU-only infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, we can apply pseudonymisation, which is one of we available data protection measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we adhere to the principle of data minimisation, ensuring that only necessary data is processed. we tenant isolation feature provides strict isolation between client corpora and per-engagement logical separation, further safeguarding sensitive information. we also have Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) in place, limiting access to authorized personnel." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we logging mechanisms include audit logs of access and system outputs, which can be used for auditing purposes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The appointment of a Data Protection Officer (DPO) and the maintenance of a data processing register are also part of we compliance framework, with a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available that aligns with GDPR Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we HDS certification, held through OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud hosting infrastructure, covers Faber IA's processing on OuraneCloud's hosting infrastructure, demonstrating we ability to meet the specific requirements for health data hosting in France." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires that all AI outputs be explainable and auditable a posteriori, and no decision may be automated without explicit validation by an authorized professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client also requires compliance with the GDPR, French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, and other regulatory frameworks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements? we have experience with French public procurement and compliance with relevant regulations such as the the GDPR and HDS framework. we AI models, including the sovereign European open-weight model used under the sovereign European open-weight model used under its open-weight licence open-weight licence and proprietary third-party models accessed under commercial licences, can provide explainable outputs to facilitate auditing a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding decision automation, we platform is designed to support human-in-the-loop validation by authorized professionals, ensuring that no decisions are automated without explicit validation. we regulatory compliance is maintained with the Security & Compliance function, specifically in the context of health deployments, and we monitor obligations such as the GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag potential legal risks related to the medical-device threshold, where certain use cases may approach the medical-device threshold." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In such scenarios, we Legal function will need to carefully assess CE/MDR implications and consequences for liability and positioning." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on the provided information, it appears that we is compliant with the mentioned requirements, but a detailed review of the specific tender terms and regulatory landscape would be necessary to confirm is and identify any additional potential risks or compliance gaps." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

