    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires an AI solution that can improve efficiency of staff, quality and safety of care delivered to patients, and integrate with existing hospital information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What innovative AI solutions can we propose to meet these requirements, and how can we ensure that we solution is explainable and transparent? we can propose an AI-powered medical documentation assistant that leverages retrieval-augmented generation capabilities to improve efficiency of staff by surfacing relevant information and drafting content at the point of need." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This solution can enhance quality and safety of care delivered to patients by providing applicable rules recall, protocol retrieval, and structured extraction capabilities, such as assisting with PMSI/ICD-10 coding from clinical notes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability and transparency, This solution will provide source citations, retrieved passages, and a retrieval trace for every interaction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, every interaction will be logged for posteriori audit, and human oversight will be built into the workflow, where the assistant proposes and the professional validates, consistent with HAS guidance. we iterative approach to development, including corpus selection and curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design, and evaluation loop, will also ensure that This solution is grounded in the hospital's own validated documents and applicable regulatory texts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By embedding the assistant into the staff's existing work environment and tools, we can avoid disrupting clinical or administrative workflows while augmenting clinical or administrative workflows in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This solution has demonstrated efficiency outcomes in comparable deployments, such as reducing processing and documentation times, and we believe This solution can bring similar benefits to the hospital setting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires that the solution contribute to reducing energy consumption and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The authority also has a sustainable development policy in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that the solution aligns with these environmental requirements, and what measures can we take to minimize the solution environmental footprint? we can ensure the solution aligns with The client environmental requirements by highlighting we partnership with green hosting providers such as OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting in the EU region, utilizes renewable energy, and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, along with heat reuse capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which contribute to reducing energy consumption. we carbon reporting capability also allows we to monitor and report the solution carbon footprint, ensuring transparency and the ability to make data-driven decisions to minimize environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these environmentally friendly practices and infrastructure, we can effectively support The client sustainable development policy while minimizing the solution's carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year demonstrates we commitment to continuous improvement in this area." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

